- **`features: ["experiencecloud"]`** — turns on Digital Experiences (Experience Cloud) at org creation, which is required before the `Network`, `CustomSite`, and ExperienceBundle metadata can be deployed.
- **`features: ["siteguestupload"]`** — the scratch-org feature that permits site guest users to upload files. This is the one requirement that has no equivalent in a settings/definition configuration outside the definition file itself, so it belongs here.
- **`experienceBundleSettings.enableExperienceBundleMetadata`** — enables the ExperienceBundle metadata API representation (instead of the legacy site zip), so the Aura-based site can be deployed and retrieved as source with `sf project deploy start`.

